<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP says output rises in most sectors.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP says output rises in most sectors.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resources and steel group The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd reported on Monday higher copper, steel and petroleum products output for December but lower coal production.</p>
<p>Production of copper in concentrate rose 73 percent in December from a year earlier while output in the first seven months of fiscal 1996/97 (June-May) was up 45 percent, BHP said.</p>
